merger_description:
Equans SAS (**Equans**) proposed to acquire 80% of the share capital of CV Services Group Pty Ltd (**CV Services Group**) either directly or through a wholly-owned subsidiary (the **Proposed Acquisition**).

Equans is a global energy and technical services company headquartered in France. In Australia, Equans operates through a local subsidiary, which supplies:

* electrical and communications installation;
* facility management services, including;

  + installation and maintenance of heating, ventilation and air conditioning (HVAC); and
  + fire protection products; and
* audio-visual integration and digital signage.

CV Services Group is an Australian technical services company. It supplies:

* infrastructure services;
* electrical design, installation and construction;
* facility management services; and
* media and signage manufacturing and installation.
